      "src": "/assets/images/main/slider/1414.jpg",
      "title": "FEEL BOUTIQUE PLAZA",
      "description": "FEEL Boutique Plaza reawakens an existing Omani house as a contemporary third place between home and work. Rather than treating its café, gallery, library, bakery, wellness rooms and gathering spaces as separate interiors, the project connects them through one material and social language. Half-arches frame selected views; locally inspired tiles can be rearranged into changing carpet-like compositions; furniture was developed around the habits of Muscat’s community; and a verse by Hafez is woven into the architecture as a graphic layer. The result is a sequence of distinct atmospheres held together by hospitality, encounter and cultural memory.\n\nHead Architect: Jalal Mashhadi Fard · Photography: Diman Studio · Area: 1,600 m² · Completed: 2024",
      "location": "Muscat - Oman",
