      "id": "00023",
      "src": "/assets/images/main/slider/1212.jpg",
      "title": "LOOKOUT/IN Cafe",
      "description": "LOOKOUT/IN turns the act of looking into the project’s central spatial experience. Mirrors placed perpendicular to the café corridor multiply its depth and blur the edge between the physical passage and its reflection. As visitors approach the apparent continuation, their own image becomes both threshold and obstacle: a direct encounter between seeing and being seen. At the social table, the triangular arrangement of seats, sightlines and a central tree encourages eye contact without forcing it.\n\nPrincipal Architect and Interior Designer: Jalal Mashhadi Fard · Photography: Diman Studio · Area: 75 m² · Completed: 2025",
      "location": "Mashhad / Iran",
      "awards": [
        { "title": "Honorable Mention", "label": "DNA Paris Design Awards 2025", "url": "https://dna.paris/winner/zoom.php?eid=71-93978-25" }
      ],
      "publications": [
